ex07_ArW__ Example 7: 2 keV Ar on amorphous W at normal incidence, compare with the SDTrimSP examples 6 and 7
# obligatory control parameters
cdat 0 1.0 0
geom 1000.0 100 0.0
atda Ar W
comp 0.0 1.0
irra 1 2000.0 0.0 1.0
# optional control parameters
thrd 1
pspr 5000
coll 1 0
damg 0.0
elst 3
exst 1 0.9999 3 0
fout 100 100 100
outp
edep
outl rang incd scat sput
